  "content": "<article class=\"gl-celebration gl-celebration-photo-ready\">\n<section class=\"gl-celebration-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"sweet-title\"><figure class=\"gl-celebration-hero-media\"><img src=\"/assets/RTG_0182.jpg\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1366\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Sweet Sixteen portrait in a blue gown\"></figure><div class=\"gl-celebration-hero-copy\"><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">GioLina · Sweet Sixteen</p><h1 id=\"sweet-title\">A celebration.<br>A signature all your own.</h1><p>Sweet Sixteen Photography &amp; Cinematography,<br>for a night worth remembering.</p><a class=\"gl-landing-button\" href=\"/contact-us-2/?occasion=sweet-sixteen\">Let’s plan your celebration</a></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-landing-wrap gl-celebration-intro\"><figure class=\"gl-celebration-intro-photo\"><img src=\"/assets/GLP_0292.jpg\" width=\"1365\" height=\"2048\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Sweet Sixteen portrait in a pink gown\"></figure><div><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">A boutique approach</p><h2>Big night energy.<br>Beautifully considered.</h2><p>We get to know the family and plan around the moments that matter to her, so you can enjoy the celebration.</p><p>From portraits before the party to the entrance, speeches and dance floor, our coverage follows the people and energy of the night.</p><a class=\"gl-landing-text-link\" href=\"/contact-us-2/?occasion=sweet-sixteen\">Tell us what you have in mind →</a></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-sweet-browse gl-landing-wrap\" aria-label=\"Explore Sweet Sixteen coverage\"><nav class=\"gl-sweet-entry-points\" aria-label=\"Explore Sweet Sixteen coverage\"><a href=\"#sweet-films\">Cinematography</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><a href=\"#sweet-photography\">Photography</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><a href=\"#sweet-photo-presentation\">Photo Presentation</a></nav></section><section class=\"gl-celebration-work\"><div class=\"gl-landing-wrap\"><div class=\"gl-landing-section-heading\"><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">Keep the night in motion</p><h2 class=\"gl-sweet-service-title\">Cinematography</h2></div><article><h3>Let the celebration move.</h3><p>The voices, music and movement of the evening, shaped into a film you can return to together.</p></article><div class=\"gl-celebration-showcase\" aria-label=\"Sweet Sixteen showcase films\" id=\"sweet-films\"><article><div class=\"gl-film-preview \"><img src=\"/assets/sweet-gianna-photo.webp\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Gianna, Sweet Sixteen portrait\" style=\"object-position:50% 35%\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"793523768\" data-film-title=\"Gianna\" aria-label=\"Play Film, Gianna\"><span>Play Film</span></button></div><h3>Gianna</h3></article><article><div class=\"gl-film-preview\" style=\"aspect-ratio:12/5\"><img src=\"/assets/sweet-gabby-photo.webp\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Gabby, Sweet Sixteen portrait\" style=\"object-position:50% 35%\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"723528961\" data-film-title=\"Gabby\" aria-label=\"Play Film, Gabby\"><span>Play Film</span></button></div><h3>Gabby</h3></article><article><div class=\"gl-film-preview\" style=\"aspect-ratio:12/5\"><img src=\"/assets/sweet-gina-marie-photo.webp\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Gina Marie, Sweet Sixteen portrait\" style=\"object-position:50% 35%\"><button type=\"button\" data-mediazilla-src=\"https://mediazilla.com/ttnbvY81xe\" data-film-aspect=\"12/5\" data-film-title=\"Gina Marie\" aria-label=\"Play Film, Gina Marie\"><span>Play Film</span></button></div><h3>Gina Marie</h3></article><article><div class=\"gl-film-preview\" style=\"aspect-ratio:16/9\"><img src=\"/assets/sweet-julia-photo.webp\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Julia, Sweet Sixteen portrait\" style=\"object-position:50% 35%\"><button type=\"button\" data-mediazilla-src=\"https://mediazilla.com/8baRrhNAed\" data-film-title=\"Julia\" aria-label=\"Play Film, Julia\"><span>Play Film</span></button></div><h3>Julia</h3></article><article><div class=\"gl-film-preview\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/641\"><img src=\"/assets/julianna-poster.webp\" width=\"1280\" height=\"641\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Julianna\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"385087191\" data-film-title=\"Julianna\" aria-label=\"Play Film, Julianna\"><span>Play Film</span></button></div><h3>Julianna</h3></article><div class=\"gl-sweet-film-inquiry\"><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">Your celebration</p><h3>Photography &amp; Cinematography, considered together.</h3><a class=\"gl-landing-button\" href=\"/contact-us-2/?occasion=sweet-sixteen\">Ask About Photography &amp; Cinematography</a></div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-sweet-presentation\" aria-labelledby=\"sweet-presentation-title\"><div class=\"gl-landing-wrap\"><figure><img src=\"/assets/sweet-julia-presentation.webp\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Julia in her red Sweet Sixteen gown beside a window\" style=\"object-position:50% 35%\"></figure><div class=\"gl-sweet-presentation-copy\"><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">The complete experience</p><h2 id=\"sweet-presentation-title\">Sweet Sixteen Cinematography Presentation</h2><a class=\"gl-sweet-presentation-cta\" href=\"https://mediazilla.com/62aYiGyhwV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View Presentation</a><a class=\"gl-landing-text-link gl-sweet-photo-jump\" href=\"#sweet-photography\">Explore Sweet Sixteen Photography →</a></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-sweet-photography gl-landing-wrap\" aria-labelledby=\"sweet-photo-title\"><div class=\"gl-sweet-photo-collage\" id=\"sweet-photography\" aria-labelledby=\"sweet-photo-title\"><header class=\"gl-sweet-collage-heading\"><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">Portraits, people and celebration</p><h2 class=\"gl-sweet-