4px)/2), 365px\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" alt=\"A tender family moment during Sweet Sixteen preparations\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"/sweet-media/s16-cdb46565126539f4-large.webp\" data-sweet-photo=\"s16-cdb46565126539f4\" aria-label=\"Enlarge A joyful family dance during a Sweet Sixteen celebration\"><img src=\"/sweet-media/s16-cdb46565126539f4-small.webp\" srcset=\"/sweet-media/s16-cdb46565126539f4-small.webp 640w, /sweet-media/s16-cdb46565126539f4-large.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) calc((100vw - 58px)/2), (max-width:1050px) calc((100vw - 84px)/2), 365px\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" alt=\"A joyful family dance during a Sweet Sixteen celebration\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"/sweet-media/s16-221168f7e10a5d14-large.webp\" data-sweet-photo=\"s16-221168f7e10a5d14\" aria-label=\"Enlarge An emotional family dance at a Sweet Sixteen celebration\"><img src=\"/sweet-media/s16-221168f7e10a5d14-small.webp\" srcset=\"/sweet-media/s16-221168f7e10a5d14-small.webp 640w, /sweet-media/s16-221168f7e10a5d14-large.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) calc((100vw - 58px)/2), (max-width:1050px) calc((100vw - 84px)/2), 365px\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" alt=\"An emotional family dance at a Sweet Sixteen celebration\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"/sweet-media/s16-40bc58e222247a92-large.webp\" data-sweet-photo=\"s16-40bc58e222247a92\" aria-label=\"Enlarge A joyful embrace during a Sweet Sixteen celebration\"><img src=\"/sweet-media/s16-40bc58e222247a92-small.webp\" srcset=\"/sweet-media/s16-40bc58e222247a92-small.webp 640w, /sweet-media/s16-40bc58e222247a92-large.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) calc((100vw - 58px)/2), (max-width:1050px) calc((100vw - 84px)/2), 365px\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" alt=\"A joyful embrace during a Sweet Sixteen celebration\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"/sweet-media/s16-7e25371ee1343218-large.webp\" data-sweet-photo=\"s16-7e25371ee1343218\" aria-label=\"Enlarge A Sweet Sixteen family portrait by the beach\"><img src=\"/sweet-media/s16-7e25371ee1343218-small.webp\" srcset=\"/sweet-media/s16-7e25371ee1343218-small.webp 640w, /sweet-media/s16-7e25371ee1343218-large.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) calc((100vw - 58px)/2), (max-width:1050px) calc((100vw - 84px)/2), 365px\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" alt=\"A Sweet Sixteen family portrait by the beach\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure></div></section><section id=\"sweet-photo-presentation\" class=\"gl-sweet-photo-presentation gl-landing-wrap\" aria-labelledby=\"sweet-photo-presentation-title\"><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">The complete photography experience</p><h2 id=\"sweet-photo-presentation-title\"><span class=\"gl-sweet-script-accent\">Sweet Sixteen</span><span class=\"gl-sweet-clean-title\">Photography Experience</span></h2><a class=\"gl-sweet-presentation-cta\" href=\"https://clients.giolinafilms.com/GabriellasUn-Sweet16\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View Presentation</a><a class=\"gl-landing-text-link\" href=\"/contact-us-2/?occasion=sweet-sixteen\">Ask About Sweet Sixteen Coverage →</a></section><section class=\"gl-sweet-planning\" aria-label=\"Preparing for your celebration\"><section class=\"gl-landing-wrap gl-celebration-experience\"><div><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">Before, during &amp; after</p><h2>Prepared for the party.<br>Present for the moment.</h2></div><ol><li><details><summary><h3>Plan it like a production</h3></summary><p>We talk through the entrance, family, traditions, formalities, special dances and the moments she cares about most, so the day feels organized without feeling staged.</p></details></li><li><details><summary><h3>Treat her like the star</h3></summary><p>On the day, we give her the same attention, direction and cinematic treatment we bring to a bride: polished portraits, beautiful movement, detail shots and room for the personality of the night to come through.</p></details></li><li><details><summary><h3>Turn the night into a film</h3></summary><p>We bring the portraits, celebration and family moments together in a film that holds onto the feeling of the night.</p></details></li></ol></section>\n<section class=\"gl-celebration-faq\"><div class=\"gl-landing-wrap gl-celebration-faq-grid\"><div><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">A few things to know</p><h2>Your celebration,<br>your questions.</h2><figure class=\"gl-sweet-faq-photo\"><img src=\"/assets/GLP_0292.jpg\" width=\"1365\" height=\"2048\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Sweet Sixteen portrait in a pink gown\"></figure></div><div><details><summary>Can we discuss photography and cinematography together?</summary><p>Yes. Tell us what you’d like to keep from the celebration, and we can discuss photography, cinematography or both.</p></details><details><summary>How do we prepare before the event?</summary><p>We talk through your plans, venue, schedule and family priorities. Share important entrances, speeches and traditions so we can plan around them.</p></details><details><summary>What coverage and final films or photos are included?</summary><p>Coverage is discussed around your celebration. Your proposal will set out the agreed coverage and final photo and film work; contact us to talk through the options.</p></details><details><summary>What does Sweet Sixteen coverage cost?</summary><p>Tell us the date, location and what you have planned. We’ll discuss the coverage and prepare a proposal for your celebration.</p></details><details><summary>How do we start?</summary><p><a href=\"/contact-us-2/?occasion=sweet-sixteen\">Send an inquiry</a> with your event date and plans, or <a href=\"https://clients.giolina.co/schedule/61f5ca5de95956002dd1c3d7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">schedule a conversation</a>.</p></details></div></div></section>\n</section><section class=\"gl-landing-inquiry\"><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">Make it yours</p><h2 class=\"gl-sweet-closing-title\">Let’s talk about your <span class=\"gl-sweet-script-accent\">Sweet Sixteen.</span></h2><a class=\"gl-landing-button\" href=\"/contact-us-2/?occasion=sweet-sixteen\">Inquire about your celebration</a><p>Prefer to speak directly? <a href=\"mailto:info@giolina.co\">info@giolina.co</a> · <a href=\"tel:8663060308\">(866) 306 0308</a></p></section>\n</article>\n<script src=\"/image-rotation.js\" defer=\"\"></script>\n<script type=\"module\" src=\"/mediazilla-player.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"/sweet-sixteen-viewer.js\" defer=\"\"></script>",
